3.List and briefly explain the 7 Key Principles of Testing in your own words, then pick any 2 and give a practical example of each from an app you use.
1. Testing shows defects: Testing se bugs ka pata chalta hai.
2. Exhaustive testing impossible: Har possible test karna possible nahi hai.
3. Early testing: Testing jaldi start karni chahiye.
4. Defect clustering: Zyada bugs kuch hi modules mein milte hain.
5. Pesticide paradox: Same tests repeat karne se naye bugs kam milte hain, isliye tests update karo.
6. Testing is context dependent: Har app ki testing alag hoti hai.
7. Absence of errors fallacy: Bug na hone ka matlab app perfect nahi hai.


